            in the convolution).
        kernel_size: int or tuple/list of 2 integer, specifying the size of the
            convolution window.
        strides: int or tuple/list of 2 integer, specifying the stride length
            of the convolution. `strides > 1` is incompatible with
            `dilation_rate > 1`.
